    CompositePipelineRunner --> DependencyCoordinator : run dependencies
    CompositePipelineRunner --> EnrichmentCoordinator : fan-out enrichers
    CompositePipelineRunner --> MergeService : merge → Gold
    CompositePipelineRunner --> CompositeCheckpointManager : checkpoint/resume
